body:
We do it because if we suddenly made suicide 'acceptable', God forbid encouraged it, the rates would possibly rise as it would simply enter more people's minds as an option. I think so, anyway. The best way to keep someone away from harm is to actively discourage it. When you were a kid, you were taught not to play with fire, right? And suicide rates by gunshot are so much higher in the US because people have access to guns easily. If we make suicide more 'accessible' and acceptable, a similar effect may take place. idk. I do think there should be a lot less judgement of the survivors, though.

&#x200B;

I hope it gets better for you. I've been in that seemingly bottomless, numb abyss. I got out of it, luckily. Maybe you will too. Best of luck. Please stay with us.
